O|                         
C|                          FITZGERALD
U|           I'd be careful if I was you, boy.
O|                         
N|          And this thing's about to turn real ugly... until...
O|                         
C|                          HENRY
U|           That's enough, Fitzgerald. Go
U|           sober up and get to sleep.
O|                          (MORE)
O|           12.
C,E|                          HENRY(CONT'D)
U|           If you're passed out when we break
