N|          trails behind him, biting at one of the corners... hanging on
N|          as Glass pulls him across the dirt.
O|                         
O|                         
S|          INT. LODGE - EVENING
O|                         
N|          Glass enters the back room with the blankets... stops when he
N|          sees the old woman slumped over to the floor, her white eyes
N|          frozen open in a lifeless stare.
O|                         
O|                         
