N|          spread... engulf the woman.
O|                         
N,G|          ANGLE ON THE GLOWING EMBERS...
O|                         
N,G|          ...floating into the night. Beyond the sparks, we see
N,G|          something else... THOSE THREE INDIANS GALLOPING TOWARD THE
N|          VILLAGE... FAST.
