N|          he just stands there. But the dog's seen enough... darts
N|          away.
O|                         
N|          Glass watches the Indians ride into the village... their
N,M|          braided hair and dress is different than the Arikara we've
N,M|          seen earlier, because these are SIOUX WARRIORS, and Glass
N|          knows it.
