N|          holds up his hand, as he takes a step back. But Three
N|          Feathers and Running Fox grab Glass... secure him... pull his
N|          jacket down off his shoulders, exposing his shirt, as Spotted
N|          Horse walks around behind Glass... raises the knife... Glass
N|          GROWLS A PLEA... but Spotted Horse slices the knife down
