N|          HANDFUL OF WORMS for Glass to see. As Glass' eyes widen in
N|          panic, Spotted Horse SLAMS THE BUTT OF HIS KNIFE against
N|          Glass' head.
O|                         
N|          Glass drops to his knees... makes a dazed grab for Spotted
N|          Horse... misses... and Spotted Horse HITS GLASS AGAIN. Glass
N|          tumbles unconscious to the dirt.
O|                         
N|          Spotted Horse says something to the others... they grab
N|          Glass' limp arms... drag him toward the horses.
O|           54.
O|                         
O|                         
