N|          Three Feathers holds the reins to another horse packed with
N|          hides. An empty horse stands beside them... waiting for
N|          Glass.
O|                         
N|          Glass is leaning over to New Moon and Little One... handing
N|          them the CRUDE BUFFALO CARVING he made from the wood.
O|                         
C|                          GLASS
P|           (taps his chest)
U|           Tatanka Wicasa.
O|           69.
O|                         
