N|          Fort Brazeau stands in the distance behind him.
O|                         
O|                         
S|          EXT. OPEN COUNTRY - DAY
O|                         
N|          Snowy and cold. Glass leads the line of riders through the
N|          snow.
O|                         
O|                         
S|          EXT. FORT UNION - EVENING
O|                         
N|          But you can't tell if it's day or night through the blizzard.
N|          Fitzgerald, Pig, Anderson, Bridger, Murphy and Stubby Joe
N|          trudge through the snow in their snowshoes... finally reach
N|          the bunkhouse.
O|                         
O|                         
S|          INT. BUNKHOUSE - EVENING
O|                         
